      "writtenOn": "2022-03-14T03:32:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK I think this is now a reasonable approach.\n\nPart of the assumption here is that the mask doesn\u0027t include outputs.\nPotentially we could include them, but it seems excessive to poll the outputs, and I can\u0027t see a place where the state of the output is expected in the mask.\n\nThe board provided signals are not interrupt driven, so these are now polled whenever power_get_signals is called.",
      "parentUuid": "751ba3a4_bed1a6b0",
      "revId": "186b7a1be94ea0d94aa586bd3eef318e8c3a8d55",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d1778cc0_33f528ab",
